    <bpmn:process id="W_W4361" name="W4361. Service-Quality Assurance Strategy, Scope &amp; Operating Model" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Service-quality strategy; competitive pressure; CX review
Frequency: Annual + on strategy change
Volume: Enterprise service-quality assurance program across all customer touchpoints
Owner: Head of Service Quality / CX (VS-13) / Quality (VS-31)
Participants: CX (VS-13), Store Ops (VS-07), Ecommerce (VS-10), Trade (VS-11), Sales Enablement (VS-124), Strategy (VS-33)
Source: workflow W4361 — Service-Quality Assurance Strategy, Scope &amp; Operating Model</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4361_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4361_Lane1" name="Head of Service Quality">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4361_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4361_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4361_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4361_Lane2" name="Service Quality">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4361_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4361_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4361_Start4" name="Service-quality strategy; competitive pressure; CX review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4361_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4361_Task5" name="Service Quality/CX set the assurance strategy — scope (in-store, ecommerce/app…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Service Quality/CX set the assurance strategy — scope (in-store, ecommerce/app, B2B/field, contact center), cadence, in-house vs agency shopper model, and the link to CX/operations/HR outcomes
Responsible (R): Head of Service Quality / CX
Accountable (A): COO / CHRO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4361_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4361_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4361_Task6" name="Service Quality/Ops map the customer journeys &amp; touchpoints to be assured…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Service Quality/Ops map the customer journeys &amp; touchpoints to be assured, align to the service standards (W4362), and define coverage (all stores × frequency)
Responsible (R): Service Quality / Store Ops / CX
Accountable (A): Head of Service Quality
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4361_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4361_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4361_Task7" name="Service Quality document the strategy, obtain approval, and cascade to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Service Quality document the strategy, obtain approval, and cascade to standards (W4362), methodology (W4363), KPI (W4364), and governance (W4365)
Responsible (R): Head of Service Quality
Accountable (A): COO / CHRO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4361_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4361_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4361_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4361_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-668 (ensure controlled execution — Service-Quality Assurance Strategy, Standards &amp; Program Design (PA-146.1).) | - CTL-668: strategy approved (COO/CHRO); scope covers all touchpoints; cadence randomized (W4363)
Owner: Head of Service Quality / CX (VS-13) / Quality (VS-31)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4361_Assoc10" sourceRef="W4361_Annotation9" targetRef="W4361_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
