    <bpmn:process id="W_W4364" name="W4364. Service-Quality KPI Framework, Targets &amp; Weighting" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Strategy (W4361); performance review
Frequency: Annual + periodic tuning
Volume: One service-quality KPI framework
Owner: Service Quality / Strategy (VS-33) / CX (VS-13)
Participants: CX (VS-13), Store Ops (VS-07), Strategy (VS-33), HR (VS-103), Finance (VS-17.4)
Source: workflow W4364 — Service-Quality KPI Framework, Targets &amp; Weighting</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4364_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4364_Lane1" name="Service Quality">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4364_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4364_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4364_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4364_Lane2" name="HR">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4364_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4364_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4364_Start4" name="Strategy (W4361); performance review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4364_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4364_Task5" name="Service Quality/Strategy define the KPI set — overall service score, touchpoint…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Service Quality/Strategy define the KPI set — overall service score, touchpoint sub-scores, critical-failure rate, recovery effectiveness, omnichannel consistency — and the weighting by business impact
Responsible (R): Service Quality / Strategy
Accountable (A): COO / CHRO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4364_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4364_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4364_Task6" name="Service Quality/Ops set targets per store/region/touchpoint, calibrate to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Service Quality/Ops set targets per store/region/touchpoint, calibrate to baseline &amp; benchmark, and define performance tiers
Responsible (R): Service Quality / Store Ops
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4364_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4364_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4364_Task7" name="HR/Finance link KPI outcomes to recognition/incentive (W4379) and to…">
