      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Program operation; privacy review; regulatory change
Frequency: Annual + continuous adherence
Volume: Program-wide privacy/compliance
Owner: Privacy/DPO (VS-91) / Service Quality / Legal (VS-100.3)
Participants: Privacy/DPO (VS-91), Legal (VS-100.3), Service Quality, Vendor (VS-34), Compliance (VS-22), HR (VS-84)
Source: workflow W4367 — Service-Quality Compliance, RA 10173 Consent &amp; Data Privacy</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4367_LaneSet3">
