Responsible (R): Service Quality / Vendor / DPO
Accountable (A): Head of Service Quality / DPO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4367_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4367_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
