      <bpmn:userTask id="W4368_Task5" name="Service Quality/EA/IT design the service-quality data architecture — shop/audit…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Service Quality/EA/IT design the service-quality data architecture — shop/audit records, scoring, evidence store, and integration to CX (VS-13), store-ops (VS-07), HR (VS-103), BI (VS-28)
